        "subject": "LU-18941 tests: fix sanity/119j HIO aarch64 read size",
        "message": "LU-18941 tests: fix sanity/119j HIO aarch64 read size\n\nOn aarch64 clients the 4KB read was only accessing a partial page,\nwhich occasionally caused a cache miss.  Always read a full page.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: 240cad9a0a (\"LU-19344 llite: set read size correctly\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: Iad61f97d3109dfca14fec07471b3a488934bd154\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/65384\nReviewed-by: Shaun Tancheff <shaun.tancheff@hpe.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\n"
